1. Starting as the Leader
The command you provided already starts the leader role. It sets up:
- UDP discovery on port 9999
- TCP control plane on port 9000
- HTTP API on port 8080
- Registry management 
NOTE : GO must be preinstalled on the host

# Initialize Go module (only needed if go.mod is missing)
go mod init github.com/dikshaWagh/meridian

# Initialize/go mod tidy (needs network access for the module dependency)
go mod tidy

# Build the binary
go build -o meridian-server ./cmd/meridian-server/

